#-----------input file for the coupled channel eq code-------------#
#Pi_tot:total parity for (alpha+d),jd:parity for daughter nucleus 
#Sd: spin of d, jt: total J for 2b system, Ed: excitation of daughter nucleus
#------------------------------------------------------------------#

&channelbeta    beta%Pi_tot=-1d0   beta%j_tot=1d0      
                beta%Pi_d=-1d0     beta%jd=1d0       beta%Ed=0d0               
                beta%Pi_alpha=1d0  beta%j_alpha=0d0   /


&meshs       nr=120      rmax=100d0         /



&systems    E=24.9631578947d0    mass_d=93d0    mass_alpha=2d0     
            z_d=41d0     z_alpha=1d0                           /


&potentials str='t'          /


&deformation beta_2=0.224   beta_4=0.087   v_0=100d0/





